      "chapter": "Shanghai",
      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Programme of Development of Greater Shanghai for 1936]",
      "caption_extra": "Greater Shanghai Municipality. 1936 Plans. The following programme of development was outlined for 1936 :—",
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": null,
          "columns": [
            "Item"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "An increased number of vocational schools for agriculture, industry and commerce."
            ],
            [
              "The establishment of two new well-equipped middle schools at the Civic Centre, one for boys and one for girls."
            ],
            [
              "For the improvement of agriculture and experimenting in collective farming, four agricultural schools with experimental farms will be opened in the districts of Kaohang, Chenju, Luhang, and Tsaoking."
            ],
            [
              "The Municipal Library and Museum to be opened at an early date, with adequate financial provision for their maintenance."
            ],
            [
              "The new Municipal Hospital and Health Laboratory to be completed and equipped for service during 1936."
            ],
            [
              "Additional health centres."
            ],
            [
              "Improvement of public health conditions in Greater Shanghai."
            ],
            [
              "Enforcement of labour health regulations."
            ],
            [
              "Improvement of the livelihood of rickshaw pullers."
            ],
            [
              "Building of civic ceremonial halls for Nantao and Chapei."
            ],
            [
              "Construction of a public crematorium."
            ],
            [
              "Speedy establishment of waterworks for Pootung."
            ],
            [
              "If finance will permit, the building of a “Round the City Tramway.”"
            ],
            [
              "If finance will permit, the completion of the East and West Dykes."
            ],
            [
              "For the purpose of promoting the sale of domestic products and developing the prosperity of Greater Shanghai, the organization of an exhibition of native goods."
            ],
            [
              "The completion of the plans for construction of a steel bridge across the Whangpoo River."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Rows: 16 as printed (one paragraph per item, unnumbered)."
      ],
      "continued": false,
